1
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,200
With this one, I'm dead serious.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,500
I'm just not sure if what I'm feeling

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,430
is because I really like him, or...

4
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:13,030
just because he's being nice to me.

5
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,470
I like him!

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,500
Yeah, we know.

7
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:18,730
I wrote this song myself.

8
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:21,130
It's not finished yet,

9
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:23,630
