12
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:28,300
I won't forget.

13
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:29,970
Promise.

14
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:34,970
I want to go to a church with you.

15
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:41,730
But wherever you go, I'm ready to go too.

16
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,770
I think we should take some space,

17
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,330
