18
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,270
Din, we're going home.

19
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:49,900
Can't I make one mistake, Mom?

20
00:00:50,430 --> 00:00:52,200
Then you have to prove

21
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,230
