22
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,800
I know you can do it.

23
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,800
No matter what, I'll be right here by your side.

24
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:03,530
Perfect timing. I'll send it to Din

25
00:01:03,530 --> 00:01:05,269
