32
00:01:58,330 --> 00:02:00,200
Was I wrong, Dad?

33
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:06,400
Wrong about what, son? Failing the exam, or wanting a boyfriend?

34
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,800
I think I was wrong

35
