38
00:02:17,270 --> 00:02:21,030
So, Din, how did the exam go today?

39
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,630
I'm sure I got in this time, Dad.

40
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:27,200
Wow, awesome! That's what I like to hear!

41
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,570
Always go in confident.

42
00:02:28,570 --> 00:02:30,600
That's my boy.

43
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:36,600
Okay, go on, go take a shower.

44
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:39,870
Then tonight, you're gaming with me all night, son.

45
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:42,600
Okay. / Okay, go, go, go.

46
00:04:58,670 --> 00:05:03,900
♪ Asking you once more, do you still remember ♪

47
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:09,170
