54
00:05:53,930 --> 00:06:02,000
♪ I want you to tell me you love me once more ♪

55
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,980
I thought that was damn good.

56
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:25,280
Really?

57
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,580
You... really liked it?

58
00:06:27,580 --> 00:06:28,580
Really.

59
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:29,580
So damn good.

60
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:31,710
Want to do one more take?

61
00:06:31,710 --> 00:06:34,250
And this time, throw in lots of ad-libs.

62
00:06:35,050 --> 00:06:36,110
Okay.

63
00:06:48,550 --> 00:06:51,650
Everyone, for this year's M.6 farewell,

64
00:06:51,650 --> 00:06:53,510
