66
00:06:57,810 --> 00:06:59,950
We've got flowers! / And sashes!

67
00:06:59,950 --> 00:07:03,880
And all of us M.5s, plus the super-cool FUN VIBE!

68
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,850
Let's do it! Come on!

69
00:07:08,650 --> 00:07:11,310
3, 2, 1.

70
00:07:11,310 --> 00:07:13,880
Yay!

71
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:16,910
Let's get to work! Work, work, work!

72
00:07:21,810 --> 00:07:24,580
Today was fucking fun. How'd we lose track of time?

73
00:07:24,580 --> 00:07:27,480
Yeah, yeah. Don't forget a warm soak at home, okay?

74
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,480
Okay.

75
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,510
Get lots of rest, everyone. / Will do.

76
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:31,280
Good.

77
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,280
Bye.

78
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,280
Bye.

79
00:07:34,810 --> 00:07:35,750
Again, huh?

80
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,950
See you, Thanop. / See you.

81
00:07:38,409 --> 00:07:39,550
Bye. / Bye.

82
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,880
Bye-bye.

83
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,650
Hi. Have you been waiting long?

84
00:07:48,150 --> 00:07:49,480
