162
00:16:57,570 --> 00:17:03,100
♪ If I slip, if I fall for you, would that be so wrong ♪

163
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:07,200
♪ The questions in my heart, I have to keep inside ♪

164
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:12,170
♪ Every day goes by, it never fades ♪

165
00:17:12,170 --> 00:17:20,670
♪ The feelings back then, the story back then, I still remember ♪

166
00:17:20,670 --> 00:17:30,730
♪ The smile you gave me, that day we sat side by side ♪

167
00:17:30,730 --> 00:17:41,070
