♪ Please tell me you love me, let me hear it once more ♪

171
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:25,500
You're from Thapfah, right?

172
00:18:26,030 --> 00:18:27,300
Yes, we are.

173
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:29,730
Thapfah Wittayanusorn.

174
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,930
You guys played really well.

175
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:36,300
Hope we get to work together sometime.

176
00:18:43,470 --> 00:18:45,470
Thank you.

177
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:56,770
Me first, Physics.

178
00:19:02,730 --> 00:19:05,570
Amazing, everyone! / Were we good?

179
00:19:06,870 --> 00:19:07,970
Solid as always, man.

180
00:19:07,970 --> 00:19:09,070
Of course.

181
00:19:09,970 --> 00:19:11,670
Amazing, guys! You're so good!

182
00:19:11,670 --> 00:19:13,130
Awesome!

183
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:21,880
Physics, while we're at it,

184
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,910
let me take Chemi home today.

185
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:26,310
I want to take care of the champ.

186
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:39,610
Then take good care of my brother.

187
00:19:42,010 --> 00:19:44,710
Fuen, then I'm sleeping at yours tonight.

188
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:46,580
Mm-hmm.

189
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:48,950
Physics, then I'm sleeping at yours tonight.

190
00:19:48,950 --> 00:19:49,810
Huh?

191
00:19:49,810 --> 00:19:52,580
Yeah. You're sleeping at Fuen's anyway.

192
00:19:54,250 --> 00:19:55,610
Want to rephrase that?

193
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:58,880
I'll drop your brother off quick and head straight home.

194
00:19:59,250 --> 00:20:00,450
Ah, okay, okay.

195
00:20:00,450 --> 00:20:01,850
Sorry, Mr. Best Friend.

196
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:04,480
Best friend, huh?

197
00:20:07,050 --> 00:20:08,180
Amazing, everyone.

198
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,680
Hi, Uncle Joe.

199
00:20:34,110 --> 00:20:36,750
Thank you.

200
00:20:37,310 --> 00:20:39,050
Thank you.

201
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:41,080
Thank you.

202
00:20:42,450 --> 00:20:43,680
Thank you.

203
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:45,250
We won't see each other again.

204
00:20:45,250 --> 00:20:46,580
Hey, thanks, buddy.

205
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:51,410
Thanks, thanks. See you.

206
00:20:51,410 --> 00:20:52,680
Study hard. / Aof!

207
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,450
Hey, what's up?

208
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,010
Here, for you. / Thanks.

209
00:20:55,010 --> 00:20:56,550
How will I live without you?

210
00:20:56,550 --> 00:20:57,380
Why?

211
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:59,680
You're my extra body part, man!

212
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,050
I'm what? / A skin tag.

213
00:21:01,050 --> 00:21:02,050
What skin tag?

214
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:03,750
A skin tag somewhere on me.

215
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:04,750
It's important, man!

216
00:21:04,750 --> 00:21:06,010
Go back and study hard.

217
00:21:06,010 --> 00:21:07,410
Can we get a photo?

218
00:21:07,410 --> 00:21:08,750
Sure, sure.

219
00:21:11,610 --> 00:21:13,550
Thank you.

220
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:20,480
Oh, thank you.

221
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:21,910
Hi, can I get a photo?

222
00:21:21,910 --> 00:21:22,580
Get in here.

223
00:21:23,350 --> 00:21:25,380
Come on, everyone in!

224
00:21:31,180 --> 00:21:32,880
You're my idol. / Thank you.

225
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:33,480
I love you!

226
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:34,710
Hey, are you into me?

227
00:21:34,710 --> 00:21:36,010
Go on, get out of here.

228
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:40,280
Okay, thank you.

229
00:21:41,480 --> 00:21:42,750
Thank you, Chemi.

230
00:21:44,810 --> 00:21:46,180
Hey, Jay, hold this!

231
00:21:46,310 --> 00:21:48,450
Aof! / What's up, man!

232
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:52,710
We graduated, man! We're done!

233
00:21:52,710 --> 00:21:53,950
You're heavy too, man.

234
00:21:53,950 --> 00:21:55,110
You got me through it.

235
00:22:07,150 --> 00:22:09,280
Come on, 1, 2, 3!

236
00:22:09,280 --> 00:22:11,010
We graduated, man!

237
00:22:26,810 --> 00:22:28,610
I'm counting on you.

238
00:22:31,780 --> 00:22:34,910
Hello, I'm Anantakan from the student council.

239
00:22:35,410 --> 00:22:37,450
That's how I'd usually introduce myself.

240
00:22:37,450 --> 00:22:40,810
But this time, let me introduce myself as a younger student.

241
00:22:44,110 --> 00:22:45,510
To everyone in M.6,

242
00:22:45,510 --> 00:22:49,180
I'd like to invite you all to the assembly hall right now.

243
00:22:49,180 --> 00:22:51,710
If you're not ready, that's okay,

244
00:22:51,710 --> 00:22:54,010
because you don't have to do a thing.

245
00:22:54,010 --> 00:22:57,350
Let us younger students take care of you for a change.

246
00:23:31,680 --> 00:23:35,050
First of all, I'd like to thank every one of you

247
00:23:35,050 --> 00:23:38,280
for bringing so much color to this home.

248
00:23:38,910 --> 00:23:42,750
Watching you grow up over these years

249
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:44,810
and make it through every obstacle

250
00:23:44,810 --> 00:23:48,410
has made me incredibly proud.

251
00:23:50,010 --> 00:23:51,850
And from this day on,

252
00:23:51,850 --> 00:23:54,880
you'll head out into a new, much bigger world

253
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:57,310
and face even tougher obstacles.

254
00:23:58,910 --> 00:24:00,450
Believe in yourselves,

255
00:24:00,450 --> 00:24:04,680
and use the strengths you've built to push through.

256
00:24:04,710 --> 00:24:07,810
I believe you'll come through with flying colors.

257
00:24:07,810 --> 00:24:10,810
As for this home, there's nothing left to worry about.

258
00:24:10,810 --> 00:24:12,850
I wish you all the best of luck.

259
00:24:13,780 --> 00:24:17,310
Finally, on behalf of all the teachers,

260
00:24:17,310 --> 00:24:20,010
I want to wish all of you, my M.6 kids,

261
00:24:20,010 --> 00:24:24,010
success in the things you enjoy

262
00:24:24,010 --> 00:24:27,010
and the chance to do what you love.

263
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:30,450
What I want to leave you with is this:

264
00:24:30,450 --> 00:24:32,710
I want every one of you

265
00:24:32,710 --> 00:24:38,050
to hold on to your friendships and cherish them.

266
00:24:38,050 --> 00:24:41,910
And I wish for all of you

267
00:24:42,550 --> 00:24:46,280
to love one another and stay friends forever, my dears.

268
00:25:41,150 --> 00:25:45,650
So today is the last day for all of you at Thapfah Wittayanusorn.

269
00:25:45,650 --> 00:25:48,010
I wish you all the happiness in the world.

270
00:25:48,010 --> 00:25:51,750
