382
00:37:14,750 --> 00:37:16,010
Oh!

383
00:37:23,850 --> 00:37:26,280
So are you mad at me?

384
00:37:27,750 --> 00:37:30,410
I'm not mad. But don't do it again.

385
00:37:30,410 --> 00:37:32,510
You mean the kiss...

386
00:37:32,510 --> 00:37:36,150
No. I mean lying to me.

387
00:37:37,350 --> 00:37:38,850
I understand.

388
00:37:39,150 --> 00:37:40,510
I won't do it again.

389
00:37:41,180 --> 00:37:44,380
Next time your mom asks me to play a part, I'll say no.

390
00:37:46,010 --> 00:37:48,950
But if she just wants to goof around, can I join in?

391
00:37:48,950 --> 00:37:49,950
Star.

392
00:37:50,410 --> 00:37:51,950
I'm just asking.

393
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:56,050
So that's why

394
00:37:56,510 --> 00:37:58,710
you're so close with my mom.

395
00:38:05,780 --> 00:38:06,850
Star.

396
00:38:12,310 --> 00:38:14,210
Be my boyfriend.

397
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:50,650
Okay, I'll go out with you.

398
00:38:52,110 --> 00:38:53,650
Let's never break up, okay?

399
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:57,510
Okay.

400
00:38:58,780 --> 00:39:00,650
Now that you've said yes,

401
00:39:01,210 --> 00:39:03,050
