406
00:39:28,750 --> 00:39:30,350
My treat.

407
00:39:43,810 --> 00:39:45,010
Din...

408
00:39:45,810 --> 00:39:47,280
I told you

409
00:39:48,210 --> 00:39:49,810
I won't stay away again.

410
00:39:52,110 --> 00:39:53,350
Enough.

411
00:39:54,980 --> 00:39:56,750
I get it.

412
00:39:59,710 --> 00:40:03,080
