413
00:40:05,210 --> 00:40:06,580
Star.

414
00:40:07,910 --> 00:40:10,310
From now on, call yourself Star, okay?

415
00:40:10,680 --> 00:40:12,210
I like it.

416
00:40:33,450 --> 00:40:35,280
So what happens to our band now?

417
00:40:36,080 --> 00:40:37,510
I don't know.

418
00:40:37,950 --> 00:40:39,810
But being with you guys

419
00:40:40,810 --> 00:40:42,150
makes me happy every day.

420
00:40:43,480 --> 00:40:45,610
Thanks for sticking with me every day.

421
00:40:56,550 --> 00:40:58,280
Ugh, how sappy can you get?

422
00:40:59,050 --> 00:41:02,410
How could I not? You won't be around anymore!

423
00:41:02,950 --> 00:41:05,050
Yeah, exactly.

424
00:41:05,380 --> 00:41:07,280
What are we gonna do without you?

425
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:08,280
Okay, come on.

426
00:41:08,280 --> 00:41:10,150
This is my last day, you know.

427
00:41:10,150 --> 00:41:13,180
Let's rehearse all-out one more time.

428
00:41:13,180 --> 00:41:15,580
Come on, come on. Okay.

429
00:41:16,450 --> 00:41:17,480
3, 2, 1.

430
00:41:38,750 --> 00:41:39,810
Been waiting long?

431
00:41:43,350 --> 00:41:44,780
Not long.

432
00:41:47,080 --> 00:41:48,150
So, are you hungry?

433
00:41:50,650 --> 00:41:51,810
Not really.

434
00:41:52,110 --> 00:41:53,410
But a little.

435
00:41:54,010 --> 00:41:56,280
Still want that place you sent yesterday?

436
00:41:56,850 --> 00:41:58,150
Yeah, I do.

437
00:41:58,150 --> 00:41:59,310
And you? Want to?

438
00:41:59,780 --> 00:42:00,780
I do.

439
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:03,480
Shall we go? After all that studying.

440
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:04,780
I'll carry that for you.

441
00:42:14,580 --> 00:42:16,410
Want to try being my boyfriend?

442
00:42:23,580 --> 00:42:25,610
But I haven't read the user manual yet.

443
00:42:26,710 --> 00:42:28,810
Is this model hard to date?

444
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:34,380
Just pay attention and switch me on

445
00:42:34,380 --> 00:42:36,180
