448
00:43:31,150 --> 00:43:32,480
"Dating a doctor..."

449
00:43:32,480 --> 00:43:33,610
"would it be stressful~?"

450
00:43:39,010 --> 00:43:41,480
That's all for today's lesson, everyone.

451
00:43:41,480 --> 00:43:43,150
See you next time. Thank you.

452
00:43:55,380 --> 00:43:56,550
Hungry?

453
00:43:57,450 --> 00:43:58,910
Yeah, I am.

454
00:43:59,350 --> 00:44:02,450
Where's Mr. Boyfriend taking me to eat today?

455
00:44:03,180 --> 00:44:05,080
Up to you, babe.

456
00:44:12,350 --> 00:44:14,850
Yes, Mr. Boyfriend.

457
00:44:26,810 --> 00:44:28,810
Okay, that's enough for today.

458
00:44:29,450 --> 00:44:30,880
Oh, thank you.

459
00:44:31,780 --> 00:44:34,250
Tinnaphat, I want to know,

460
00:44:35,110 --> 00:44:37,580
