461
00:44:41,910 --> 00:44:45,750
Because the UK has good universities

462
00:44:46,010 --> 00:44:49,650
and I also want to improve my English

463
00:44:50,510 --> 00:44:53,780
and I want to become more independent.

464
00:44:56,310 --> 00:45:00,780
What differences do you expect between Thailand and the UK?

465
00:45:01,950 --> 00:45:04,650
Differences, differences.

466
00:45:05,250 --> 00:45:11,280
I think the students from the UK talk more in classes

467
00:45:11,280 --> 00:45:14,580
and do more independent research.

468
00:45:15,350 --> 00:45:17,380
But I really want to know,

469
00:45:17,380 --> 00:45:19,980
what is your dream, Tinnaphat?

470
00:45:24,850 --> 00:45:28,310
I want to have a good life and a good relationship.

471
00:45:30,410 --> 00:45:31,980
Good luck with that.

472
00:45:32,410 --> 00:45:34,050
Thank you.

473
00:45:45,680 --> 00:45:46,680
Physics!

474
00:45:48,210 --> 00:45:50,480
Why did the university email me?

475
00:45:51,410 --> 00:45:53,310
