480
00:46:10,880 --> 00:46:13,780
I'll look once my scores are out.

481
00:46:16,550 --> 00:46:17,880
Okay, sure.

482
00:46:18,450 --> 00:46:20,510
Now stop making that face.

483
00:46:20,510 --> 00:46:22,610
There's still plenty of time. Chill.

484
00:46:43,250 --> 00:46:47,780
Whether I look today or another day...

485
00:46:50,610 --> 00:46:52,450
