486
00:46:57,450 --> 00:46:58,280
Here goes!

487
00:46:59,010 --> 00:47:00,110
Let's just look now.

488
00:47:01,210 --> 00:47:02,280
Let's do it!

489
00:47:06,480 --> 00:47:07,810
Wait.

490
00:47:12,980 --> 00:47:14,750
