492
00:47:23,610 --> 00:47:25,450
Ugh.

493
00:47:37,810 --> 00:47:41,380
Now I get why you like listening to my heartbeat.

494
00:47:45,480 --> 00:47:46,480
What?

495
00:47:46,480 --> 00:47:48,010
Since when are you so flirty?

496
00:47:58,380 --> 00:47:59,810
You check it for me.

497
00:48:00,350 --> 00:48:01,710
I can't bear to look.

498
00:48:24,510 --> 00:48:31,880
"We regret to inform you that your application has been unsuccessful."

499
00:49:06,180 --> 00:49:10,010
Fuen, I was thinking, when we go...

500
00:49:10,710 --> 00:49:14,280
Why don't we take a language course for a year?

501
00:49:14,980 --> 00:49:17,580
At least that way, we'd go together.

502
00:49:21,410 --> 00:49:23,110
I don't want to go like that.

503
00:49:25,280 --> 00:49:26,980
You know that if I go

504
00:49:32,280 --> 00:49:34,950
I'd only want to go to university with you.

505
00:49:52,910 --> 00:49:53,910
Then...

506
00:49:58,150 --> 00:49:59,680
I'll just stay here.

507
00:50:18,150 --> 00:50:19,750
I'm not going.

508
00:50:20,210 --> 00:50:23,280
I'll wait till you get in next year and go with you then.

509
00:50:25,010 --> 00:50:26,680
Physics...

510
00:50:28,980 --> 00:50:30,650
You can't do that.

511
00:50:31,480 --> 00:50:32,810
You have to go.

512
00:50:35,810 --> 00:50:37,810
How am I supposed to go?

513
00:50:41,150 --> 00:50:43,380
I can't leave you behind.

514
00:50:52,480 --> 00:50:55,380
I'm not saying you'd be leaving me behind.

515
00:50:57,980 --> 00:51:01,550
I'm saying don't leave your own future behind.

516
00:51:07,780 --> 00:51:09,850
I've told you before

517
00:51:13,350 --> 00:51:16,610
that my whole damn future always has you in it.

518
00:51:20,610 --> 00:51:23,180
I've never been able to picture it without you.

519
00:51:34,250 --> 00:51:36,050
So how am I supposed to live?

520
00:51:45,310 --> 00:51:47,680
But you have to accept it, Physics.

521
00:51:51,110 --> 00:51:52,980
I'm the one who didn't make it.

522
00:51:56,150 --> 00:52:01,250
I'm sorry I can't go with you.

523
00:52:29,180 --> 00:52:31,350
Then don't push me away.

524
00:52:39,780 --> 00:52:41,780
This is the one thing

525
00:52:47,110 --> 00:52:49,380
I'll never change my mind about.

526
00:53:03,310 --> 00:53:04,850
You're sure, right?

527
00:53:13,010 --> 00:53:13,950
Right.

528
00:53:39,580 --> 00:53:41,110
I'm sorry.

529
00:53:56,780 --> 00:53:58,280
I'm sorry.

530
00:54:24,510 --> 00:54:29,980
"One year later"

531
00:55:00,180 --> 00:55:06,550
"Don't you ever cheat on me."

532
00:55:36,110 --> 00:55:39,610
Hey, Fuen, what's this? Sneaking off on a solo trip again?

533
00:55:39,980 --> 00:55:43,210
Well, I'm on my own. Who else would I go with?

534
00:55:44,380 --> 00:55:48,410
Wait till I'm back. I'll be on break in no time.

535
00:55:48,410 --> 00:55:49,650
Wow.

536
00:55:50,250 --> 00:55:53,580
Wait for you? I'd wither and die first.

537
00:55:55,710 --> 00:55:59,610
Then... then can you tell me where you're going?

538
00:56:04,750 --> 00:56:06,510
Take a guess.

539
00:56:06,510 --> 00:56:07,710
Go on, guess.

540
00:56:08,850 --> 00:56:10,080
Mm...

541
00:56:11,450 --> 00:56:12,610
Japan.

542
00:56:13,150 --> 00:56:14,150
Wrong.

543
00:56:15,910 --> 00:56:17,410
Hong Kong.

544
00:56:17,850 --> 00:56:18,850
Wrong.

545
00:56:20,280 --> 00:56:21,580
Singapore.

546
00:56:21,580 --> 00:56:22,580
Wrong.

547
00:56:22,910 --> 00:56:24,710
Ugh, then just tell me already.

548
00:56:24,710 --> 00:56:25,950
I want to know now.

549
00:56:26,910 --> 00:56:31,510
Then I'll text you once I get there.

550
00:56:31,510 --> 00:56:35,850
Hmph, no. Please tell me. I just want to know.

551
00:56:35,850 --> 00:56:38,010
Or I'll just worry about you again.

552
00:56:41,110 --> 00:56:42,480
I love you so damn much.

553
00:56:42,480 --> 00:56:46,210
I'll call you when I get there. Bye.

554
00:57:03,110 --> 00:57:07,210
"I like Physics... Can you help me with this? Please. (Star)"

555
00:57:07,210 --> 00:57:12,010
"I've been wanting to tell you... I like you. Do you have a boyfriend? (Din)"

556
00:57:12,010 --> 00:57:16,810
"You don't have to stay hung up on whoever it is you said isn't around to chase. (Jay)"

557
00:57:16,810 --> 00:57:21,610
"From now on, this is a secret between us. (Physics)"

558
00:57:21,610 --> 00:57:24,410
"Imagine no Star, no friendship. This room's our world."

559
00:57:24,410 --> 00:57:26,410
"Would you like me, Fuen? (Physics)"

560
00:57:26,410 --> 00:57:28,750
"Our last talk. Can we talk properly, Din?"

561
00:57:28,750 --> 00:57:31,210
"I treated you badly. Please forgive me. (Yok)"

562
00:57:31,210 --> 00:57:33,080
"Still playing hard to get? (Jay)"

563
00:57:33,080 --> 00:57:36,010
"Aof will see Chemi still likes him. Look at his eyes. (Zac)"

564
00:57:36,010 --> 00:57:40,810
"Really? How long have you been together? You brought him to meet me. (Star's dad)"

565
00:57:40,810 --> 00:57:43,610
"You fear a letdown, since you want Aof to have him. (Fuen)"

566
00:57:43,610 --> 00:57:45,610
"I did once. He let me down. (Physics)"

567
00:57:45,610 --> 00:57:47,080
"I can't be away from you."

568
00:57:47,080 --> 00:57:48,610
"I like you. Not Star..."

569
00:57:48,610 --> 00:57:50,410
"But you left, no warning. (Fuen)"

570
00:57:50,410 --> 00:57:53,250
"I'll tell Dad the truth. It must've been hard, Aof."

571
00:57:53,250 --> 00:57:55,210
"I'm sorry. I'm really sorry. (Memii)"

572
00:57:55,210 --> 00:57:56,810
"Whenever you're ready. (Aof)"

573
00:57:56,810 --> 00:58:00,010
"After the match. But win it and score at least five. (Chemi)"

574
00:58:00,010 --> 00:58:01,380
"I'm going crazy. (Fuen)"

575
00:58:01,380 --> 00:58:04,780
"Sorry. We won't fight again, no matter what. (Physics)"

576
00:58:04,780 --> 00:58:06,080
"I'd hold you back. (Star)"

577
00:58:06,080 --> 00:58:07,780
"No. You keep me going. (Din)"

578
00:58:07,780 --> 00:58:09,610
"Show your mom I make you better. (Star)"

579
00:58:09,610 --> 00:58:12,110
"My mom asked you to do this, right? (Din)"

580
00:58:12,110 --> 00:58:14,410
"She didn't ask. I pulled away myself. (Star)"

581
00:58:14,410 --> 00:58:17,010
"Are you asking me to be your boyfriend? (Star)"

582
00:58:17,010 --> 00:58:19,210
"That's what I'm doing right now. (Din)"

583
00:58:19,210 --> 00:58:20,710
"Not going to the US? (Fuen)"

584
00:58:20,710 --> 00:58:23,980
"You said yes, so I'm staying close to my boyfriend. (Physics)"

585
00:59:14,380 --> 00:59:17,080
How was that? I scored.

586
00:59:17,080 --> 00:59:18,280
Did I look cool?

587
00:59:20,780 --> 00:59:21,780
Mm.

588
00:59:33,850 --> 00:59:35,350
Great job.

589
00:59:36,680 --> 00:59:38,610
I wish you'd come watch me every day.

590
00:59:41,580 --> 00:59:44,850
I wish you'd hurry and come study here with me.

591
00:59:46,910 --> 00:59:48,580
I'll be right behind you.

592
00:59:48,580 --> 00:59:49,550
Mm-hmm.

593
01:00:00,610 --> 01:00:02,610
You're so cool, Aof.

594
01:00:03,080 --> 01:00:05,010
I'm heading back to the game.

595
01:00:08,210 --> 01:00:09,480
You've got this!
